# Agent rules

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root first. It is the single source of truth.

Then, based on the folder you are editing, read the matching nested file:

| Folder | Rules file |
|---|---|
| `app/` | `app/AGENTS.md` |
| `components/` | `components/AGENTS.md` |
| `lib/` | `lib/AGENTS.md` |

Documentation: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
Skills: `.agents/skills/` — scan `SKILL.md` frontmatter descriptions, load on demand.
